Date: Thu, 21 Aug 2014 21:33:56 +0400
Subject: [Buildroot] [PATCH v2] ARC: bump tools to 2014.08 release
Message-ID: <1408642436-2489-1-git-send-email-abrodkin@synopsys.com>
List-Id: <buildroot.busybox.net>
MIME-Version: 1.0
